'; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">수강신청 및 등록금 납부만으로는 복학처리가 되지 않습니다.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 군제대복학예정자의 전역일자가 1/4선</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(2013.03.29)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 이후일 경우에는&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 대학원지원팀&nbsp;☎(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">054)478-7014~7016,7018</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">으로 문의 바람 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청절차 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;①&nbsp; kit포탈 → 원스톱서비스 로그인 → 학사관리 → 학적→ 복학신청</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;≪특히 예비군대상자는 정확한 개인정보를 입력 바람≫ </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">② 복학 확정 여부 확인 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">신청(및 구비서류 제출) 후 4일 이내 확정 여부 확인 가능</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">≪조회 : kit포탈 → 원스톱서비스 로그인 → 학적부 → 학적자료조회 → 학적변동≫</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※ 복학 허가는 수업일수 1/4선</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(2013.03.29)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">까지만 허용이 가능함 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">단, 등록기간</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">[2013. 02. 25(월)~28(목)]</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">내에 등록금을 납부하여야 합니다.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;다. 인터넷으로 복학 신청 시 제출서류 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"37\" valign=\"center\" width=\"80\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">구 분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORD